ty","/arc-plc/iowa/clayton-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 36 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids in Clayton County. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 52% of normal in September to October and 150% in June to July. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 177% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 27157 had its driest year in 1988 at 57% of normal.</p>"}
